'''Mutations''' are a type of crop created in the [[Greenhouse]]. They are created by arranging crops in specific patterns around an empty soil plot and grant special {{Green|positive}} and/or {{Red|negative}} effects.

'''Mutations''' can be analyzed in the [[Crop Analyzer]], accessed either via the {{Zone|Underground Lab}}  or by calling {{NPCSprite|Jake}} on an [[Abiphones|Abiphone]].  Analyzing a mutation for the first time grants bonus [[Copper]] and contributes to the {{Coll|DNA Analysis Milestone}}.

'''Mutations''' can be stored in the {{ID|Small Mutations Sack!Mutations Sack}}. The recipes for it are unlocked at {{Coll|DNA Analysis Milestone I}}, {{Coll|DNA Analysis Milestone III}}, and {{Coll|DNA Analysis Milestone V}}.

