== Modifiers ==
{{Main|Greenhouse}}
{{Sectionstub}}
Placed '''Mutations''' affect their surrounding Mutations and Crops. These effects will lock once the Mutation or Crop reach their final stage. Furthermore planting unique Crops in [[Greenhouse]] will give {{Green|+3% Yield}} and {{Green|+2.5% Growth Speed}} per, up to {{Green|12}} times ({{ID|Moonflower}} and {{ID|Sunflower}} count as the same crop, same for {{ID|Red Mushroom}} and {{ID|Brown Mushroom}}).

